{"answer":"The original v1 schedule is Thursday at 09:30 local time. Among the supplied records, the current instruction is Thursday at 10:00 local time: v2 expressly replaces the time in v1. This conclusion does not rule out an unsupplied later change.","approaches":[{"description":"Read each record’s stated time, then apply v2’s explicit statement that it replaces v1’s time.","id":"explicit-replacement","outcome":"candidate","reason":"The amendment directly identifies both the replacement relation and the new time."},{"description":"Use the creation-day labels alone to decide which time controls.","id":"chronology-alone","outcome":"rejected","reason":"The express replacement statement, rather than chronology alone, supports the conclusion."}],"change_log":["Retained the conclusion’s limitation to the supplied records, so it does not assert that no later amendment exists.","Distinguished source attributions from the derived conclusion and preserved the unresolved locality/time-zone issue.","Returned no tool requests, as required."],"claims":[{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"Supplied schedule-original text","citations":[{"end":17,"quote":"Draft schedule v1","source_id":"schedule-original","start":0},{"end":80,"quote":"Thursday at 09:30 local time.","source_id":"schedule-original","start":51}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"original-time","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The supplied v1 record states Thursday at 09:30 local time.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"Supplied schedule-amendment text","citations":[{"end":19,"quote":"Signed amendment v2","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":0},{"end":108,"quote":"Thursday at 10:00 local time.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":79}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"amended-time","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The supplied signed v2 amendment states Thursday at 10:00 local time.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"Supplied schedule-amendment text","citations":[{"end":148,"quote":"This amendment replaces the time in v1.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":109}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"replacement-statement","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The supplied v2 amendment expressly states that it replaces the time in v1.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"Derived in apply-replacement from the two stated times and the explicit replacement statement.","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":["original-time","amended-time","replacement-statement"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"current-supported-time","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"Among the supplied records, Thursday at 10:00 local time is the current instruction, while Thursday at 09:30 local time is the original v1 schedule.","step_ids":["read-original-time","read-amendment","apply-replacement"],"tool_ids":[]}],"open_questions":["The supplied records do not rule out a later, unsupplied instruction that supersedes v2.","The records do not identify the locality or time-zone identifier meant by “local time.”"],"proof_steps":[{"citations":[{"end":80,"quote":"Thursday at 09:30 local time.","source_id":"schedule-original","start":51}],"depends_on":[],"id":"read-original-time","justification":"This is the time explicitly stated in the supplied v1 record.","statement":"Record v1’s stated meeting time as Thursday at 09:30 local time."},{"citations":[{"end":108,"quote":"Thursday at 10:00 local time.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":79},{"end":148,"quote":"This amendment replaces the time in v1.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":109}],"depends_on":[],"id":"read-amendment","justification":"The supplied amendment explicitly states both its time and its replacement relation to v1.","statement":"Record that v2 states Thursday at 10:00 local time and replaces the time in v1."},{"citations":[],"depends_on":["read-original-time","read-amendment"],"id":"apply-replacement","justification":"Within the supplied two-record set, the explicit replacement statement makes the v2 time controlling and leaves the v1 time as the original entry.","statement":"Conclude that 10:00 is the current instruction among the supplied records and 09:30 is the original v1 time."}],"question_status":"answered","tool_requests":[]}
